# Bounded live-state successor design

REPORT-v2.md contains the corrected, proposed design. REPORT.md and
REPORT-CORRECTION.json preserve the earlier wording and correction. The
proposal is source inspection and does not implement or approve a new verifier.

REGISTRATION.json and the extension registrations identify the time-bound
source and record windows. READ-RECEIPT.json preserves an initially truncated
output and a prior general-scope privacy registration, including the later
exact registered rereads. NAVIGATION-RESULTS.json and TREE-INVENTORY.json are
bounded metadata, not complete dynamic-dependency or source-body credit.

`verify-packet.py --git-repo <publication-repository>` compares selected
source bytes and the full tree listing to the specified commit without running
product code or any historical evidence driver. The recorded run used local
Git objects. The full historical snapshot and all referenced input objects are
not copied into this packet; the listing and Git identity support recovery
only while those objects remain available.
